    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d165-a1">

                <pb facs="0427" n="331" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg331"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 797.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Telegraphic correspondence with consul at
                    Amoy</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram No. 78.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Amoy</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-08-05T06:00:00+08:05">5, 8, 1874, 6 <hi rendition="#italic"
                                >a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Seward</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Shanghai:</hi></p>
                <p>Le Gendre arrived here to-day, I presume en route to Formosa. What instructions
                    from Peking?</p>
                <closer><signed>HENDERSON</signed>, [<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                    >seal.</hi>]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
